  unitName: Mystic Voodoo Child (EU)
  unitId: 730154
  unitNumber: 7092
  description: "Voodoo Child is now part of Coal Cauldron\u2019s gang. He was at
    an improvised concert when an opposing gang tried to attack the spectators. Voodoo
    Child only had to brush his fingers past some strings and the attackers, extremely
    powerful though they were, became so weak that an angry old lady in attendance
    was able to send them packing. No one would want to miss out on the power to
    reduce their enemy\u2019s strength to nothing."
  summonDesc: The concert is just starting!
  fusionDesc: "You\u2019re not pushing your luck a bit?"
  evoDesc: More volume, more decibels, more power!
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
